<h2>Conclusion – Give This Underrated Classic a Chance</h2>
<p>Whether you’re a seasoned Castlevania veteran or a newcomer looking for a deep, rewarding platformer, <em>Castlevania: Aria of Sorrow</em> deserves a spot at the top of your GBA play list. Its soul system, narrative twist, and polished execution set it apart from the crowd, and the lack of mainstream hype only makes the discovery feel more personal.</p>
<p>Don’t let the Reddit upvotes be the only reason you hear about it—experience the game yourself, experiment with souls, and join the growing community of fans who finally recognize this GBA masterpiece.</p>

